      "note": "PROVISIONAL machine alignment by Codex, Tibetan-first original. Own earlier source preparation is disclosed; no English-first proposal or semantic judgment was read. The two causal sequences resolve separately: byas pa owns the second and fourth provides, and skye ba owns the two gets, not the relative-clause gyur pa. The four source reg bya occurrences own feel, sensation, feel, sensation in that order. Both consciousness compounds have unique body/consciousness members; earlier rays on the body are explanatory expansions. Four active agentives have no separate English word. The pronoun/dependence/relative constructions, these two, then, the repeated spirit subjects and So too with are not forced into separate atoms. Springtime and wintertime are preserved whole. The C15:416 and C18:1130 English omit of before cold; the actual C05 wording is preserved, not corrected from them. No source or hgm_gloss is changed."
